- considerations for file version 3.0.0.0
    - the file format is not meant for streaming, so all field lengths should be replaced by terminations or counts
        - item name as \0 terminated
        - structure length -> relation count
    - allow storing item identifier, item type, item subtype, item version (joint value) and item name as optionals
    - allow storing archive root item identifier as optional
    - store item name and item structure in place
- no exceptions please
    - move to std::expected<..., Error>
    - also replace bool returns by std::expected<void, Error>
